Use case: identity-preserve. Asset type: production transparent pixel-art character animation sprite sheet, NOT a room illustration.
References: first image activities.png is the approved heroine design and rendering style. Second activity-expansion.png same heroine, preserve identity. Third personal-study.png shows the exact perspective of the purple armchair she must comfortably occupy; DO NOT include any furniture or background in output.
Create a NEW 4 columns by 2 rows sprite sheet, 1536x1024, with eight equal 384x512 transparent cells, no labels, no separators, no shadows outside her body. Same ADULT female university scholar as references, same face, long wavy dark brown hair with purple ribbon, richly shaded royal purple academic jacket antique gold embroidery, ivory blouse and tie, charcoal pleated skirt ending above the knees, opaque dark tights and brown lace-up boots. Golden dolphin brooch. NO SATCHEL, NO SHOULDER STRAP in any cell.
Crucial pose: sitting ON A CHAIR, not kneeling on the ground. Three-quarter view facing slightly toward screen right, camera elevated about 10 degrees matching the armchair. Back gently reclined against an invisible backrest, hips grounded on an invisible flat cushion, thighs extending forward nearly horizontally, knees bent near 90 degrees, shins hanging downward and boots below knees, NOT folded under her, NOT crossed, NO long dress pooled on ground. Fixed head size, hips, shoulders, thighs, knees, boots and body location across every cell. Character full seated silhouette about 360px tall centered in each 384x512 cell, feet aligned at y=480. Hands/book may move slightly but entire torso and boots remain registered.
Cell sequence row-major:
1 seated reading, relaxed book open low in hands above lap, gaze down;
2 same pose delicately turning one page with right hand;
3 same pose looking up briefly, book remains in lap;
4 same pose resting without book, hands gently on thighs;
5 same pose holding a small ivory tea mug at chest level;
6 same pose taking a small sip, elbow natural;
7 same pose calm resting eyes closed;
8 same pose reading with a subtle blink.
Style: match exactly sophisticated richly shaded 16-bit pixel art of references, visible crisp pixel clusters, grown-up proportions, no anime redesign, no chibi, no smooth vector or cartoon. Warm sunset highlights from right and subtle cool purple shadows. No seat, cushion, blanket, laptop, text, watermark or decorative background. True transparent alpha.

Use case: identity-preserve. Asset type: transparent production pixel-art character sprites. References: activities.png and activity-expansion.png are the approved canonical adult heroine; personal-study.png gives camera angle and workstation perspective ONLY. Keep the approved face, long wavy dark brown hair, purple ribbon, royal purple academic jacket with antique gold embroidery, ivory blouse and tie, charcoal pleated skirt, opaque dark tights, brown lace-up boots and dolphin brooch exactly. No redesign. NO SATCHEL, NO CROSSBODY STRAP.
Create one 4-column by 2-row sheet, 1536x1024, eight equal 384x512 transparent cells, no text or labels. Render the full character only, no furniture, laptop, backdrop or shadows. She must sit properly at the illustrated desk, seen from BEHIND in elevated three-quarter rear view facing diagonally UP-LEFT (toward a laptop), NOT a strict side profile. Her back is visible to the camera, hips resting on an invisible office chair cushion, thighs project forward away from camera under an invisible desk, knees bent 90 degrees and boots hang below knees. Adult anatomical proportions. Upper body tall and naturally upright; feet below seat, not folded under her, no kneeling or floor sitting, no pooled long dress. Character silhouette about 400px tall centered consistently with boots at cell y=480. Every seated frame has identical hip/shoulder/boot locations, body width, head size and foreshortening.
Rows read left to right:
1 seated typing with both hands reaching diagonally up-left to an invisible keyboard at natural desk height;
2 same exact pose, tiny alternating finger motion;
3 same exact seated pose pausing to think, one hand gently near chin;
4 same exact pose consulting a small open book held just above desk level;
5 same exact pose turning a page in that book;
6 same exact seated pose writing notes in a notebook held at desk level, small pen;
7 same writing pose with subtly changed pen tip and wrist;
8 rear three-quarter half-standing transition from chair, knees still bent, torso lifting gently; empty hands.
Maintain crisp richly shaded 16-bit pixel-art quality of references, no anime/chibi redesign. Warm sunset rim light and subdued purple ambient shading. True alpha transparency. Keep all furniture separate so a real chair backrest can cover her lower back at runtime.
